    {
      "id": "6a1bed64b4f142288911d737",
      "text": "Cosense Personal Access Token",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215146
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c0b",
      "text": "from [2026/05/26]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c0c",
      "text": "[Cosense Personal Access Token]！？！？！？[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215157
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c0d",
      "text": " https://scrapbox.io/settings/personal-access-tokens",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c0e",
      "text": " [/shokai/AI生成したコードを完全に理解すべき状況と、する必要ない状況の判別方法 (2026/5時点)#6a12f3420000000000320cd4]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c0f",
      "text": " なにそれ",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c10",
      "text": " いつの間にそんなの生えてたの？？？",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c11",
      "text": " [connect.sid]を代替できるかも！",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c12",
      "text": " \t書き込みは引き続きできない感じか[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c13",
      "text": " \t ビジネスプランのService Accountの個人版のような感じ",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c14",
      "text": " \t `PersonalAccessTokenNotAllowedError: This endpoint is not available via Personal Access Token.`というエラーが存在するので一部APIも明示的に弾いている",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c15",
      "text": " \t  read系のみにしている",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c16",
      "text": " \t  なるほど「非公開のプロジェクトをAIに読ませたい」的な話でconnect.sidを使われてフリーダムになるよりreadに特化したトークンを出そうという設計判断なのか[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9c4e40000000000832b1f",
      "text": " \t  writeもできている気がする[katayama8000.icon]",
      "userId": "64574844983f38be90afb67e",
      "created": 1791608037,
      "updated": 1791608071
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9c4f00000000000832b20",
      "text": " \t  \t2026/10/10",
      "userId": "64574844983f38be90afb67e",
      "created": 1791608056,
      "updated": 1791608056
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c17",
      "text": " 👀[meganii.icon][yosider.icon][sta.icon][terang.icon][mtane0412.icon][caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c18",
      "text": "\tようやく来てくれたか[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c19",
      "text": "\t\t[https://gyazo.com/2a59f1a700575e9af44ba1ccc5043a49]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c1a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1780215141
    },
    {
      "id": "6a1bed640000000000d94c1b",
      "text": " トークンの対象プロジェクトを限定したい[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1780215141,
      "updated": 1791615856
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9e38c0000000000c2c770",
      "text": "  全プロジェクト触れてしまうのは怖い",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1791615881,
      "updated": 1791615901
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9e3a00000000000c2c771",
      "text": "  一応、トークン用の別垢作って対象にしたいプロジェクトにだけ参加すればできるけども",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1791615902,
      "updated": 1791615973
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9fa5f000000000079a08f",
      "text": "  わか〜る[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1791621727,
      "updated": 1791621733
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9fa65000000000079a090",
      "text": "   できればread onlyも設定できるとうれしい",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1791621733,
      "updated": 1791621750
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac9e3500000000000c2c76f",
